{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:02:27.146306+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 36, "evidence_quote": "今天是8月10號了 真快 我得先看一下 8月10號了啊", "evidence_start_char": 9, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v4-forced-retry", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000_000", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 0, "point_text": "今天是8月10号了，很多战友给我发了很多信息。", "point_type": "context", "segment_id": "LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000", "significance": "说明了当前的时间背景和战友们的反应。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:02:27.146306+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 115, "evidence_quote": "很多戰友很多戰友 很少發信息的戰友 給我發了很多信息 關於單身父親單身母親 包括這個老人家的生日啊", "evidence_start_char": 66, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v4-forced-retry", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000_001", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 1, "point_text": "很多战友对单亲家庭和老人生日的看法是一致的。", "point_type": "argument", "segment_id": "LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000", "significance": "反映了战友们的共同观点。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:02:27.146306+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 180, "evidence_quote": "今天早上我跟郝海東先生 我們倆也對話 大家感受的是一樣的", "evidence_start_char": 152, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v4-forced-retry", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000_002", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 2, "point_text": "郝海东先生也表达了类似的观点。", "point_type": "argument", "segment_id": "LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000", "significance": "说明了观点的一致性。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:02:27.146306+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 239, "evidence_quote": "我們在國內的親人 父母親人 他們已經被共產黨洗澡洗澡 成了殭屍人物了 所以他現在發自內心的不接受 咱們的想法", "evidence_start_char": 185, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v4-forced-retry", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000_003", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 3, "point_text": "国内的亲人已经被共产党影响，变得不接受外界的想法。", "point_type": "argument", "segment_id": "LIVE_20200810_001_SEG_000000", "significance": "描述了国内亲人的态度。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
